              "name": "note",
              "value": "This sample includes a focal male with Gp-9 B genotype and 41 of his brothers. The focal male was the offspring of a Gp-9Bb queen from a multiple-queen colony originally collected near Athens, Georgia in 2008. The 41 brothers were the progeny of the queen after transfer of the colony to the laboratory and isolation of the queen with workers for 1 year to ensure that all progeny in the colony were her offspring."
